WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
First you pick the language you speak and the one you are learning.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.500
The path shows where you are, and every stop on it is a puzzle.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
I chose tonal keys over outlined ones, so the handwritten puzzle stays louder than the keys.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.200
Right after you solve a puzzle, you see your streak and a daily reminder.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.600
Flash cards bring back solved words, sorted by how well you knew them, so you remember them.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.233
The words you learn plant flowers, and each level from A1 to C1 has its own garden.
